WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.291
- It's amazing what you can
do when you're just authentic.

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:05.376
It's amazing what you can do

00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:07.560
when you're just true to yourself.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.296
I am a woman with a beard

00:00:10.296 --> 00:00:14.105
when a beard is supposed
to be a manly thing.

00:00:14.105 --> 00:00:17.355
(bouncy, mellow music)

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.475
My name's Harnaam Kaur, I'm 26 years old.

00:00:21.475 --> 00:00:25.613
I work as an anti-bullying
activist, and I model too.

00:00:25.613 --> 00:00:28.743
Polycystic ovary syndrome
is as simple as saying

00:00:28.743 --> 00:00:31.765
that I have more testosterone in my body

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:34.805
than the female sex
hormone and the side effect

00:00:34.805 --> 00:00:38.405
of the condition is weight
gain or weight loss,

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:42.582
diabetes, alopecia, obviously facial hair.

00:00:42.582 --> 00:00:44.243
In school I was bullied horrendously

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:46.304
because of the way that my body was.

00:00:46.304 --> 00:00:47.713
I thought that the bullying would stop

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:51.023
if I removed my facial
hair so I started tweezing,

00:00:51.023 --> 00:00:54.531
bleaching, waxing, shaving,
using hair removal creams,

00:00:54.531 --> 00:00:56.481
but the hair growths just came back

00:00:56.481 --> 00:00:58.772
even longer, darker, thicker.

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:00.810
I was at the age of 16
when I hit my lowest

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.021
and I was very suicidal, and
I was just sick and tired

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:04.584
of all the body shaming and bullying,

00:01:04.584 --> 00:01:07.269
and people not letting me live
my life the way I want to,

00:01:07.269 --> 00:01:09.317
and I thought, right, you're
gonna grow your beard out

00:01:09.317 --> 00:01:12.837
and see how you like her and
see how she forms on your face.

00:01:12.837 --> 00:01:15.920
(lively piano music)

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.482
I obviously look after my beard.

00:01:19.482 --> 00:01:21.548
I've given her a name as well, Sundidi.

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:22.649
I think a lot of men just look at me

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:27.038
because my beard's just sometimes
a lot better than theirs.

00:01:27.038 --> 00:01:28.328
Sorry.

00:01:28.328 --> 00:01:30.210
All the negativity that I went through,

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.383
I turned into something positive

00:01:31.383 --> 00:01:32.991
and I made a career out of it.

00:01:32.991 --> 00:01:35.671
You know, I’m in the media absolutely everywhere,

00:01:35.671 --> 00:01:39.108
very fortunate to, you know, to be able to reach

00:01:39.108 --> 00:01:41.861
such a vast amount of people,

00:01:41.861 --> 00:01:43.123
'cause there are so many women out there,

00:01:43.123 --> 00:01:45.077
even men that suffer from body shaming

00:01:45.077 --> 00:01:46.234
but don't speak about it.

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:49.146
As one woman said, "I'm not
suicidal because of you."

00:01:49.146 --> 00:01:51.394
So that to me just really ensured to me

00:01:51.394 --> 00:01:53.935
that what you're doing is having

00:01:53.935 --> 00:01:56.423
a positive effect on people.

00:01:56.423 --> 00:01:59.285
If there was a pill that
could reverse all this, no,

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.485
would never take it.

00:02:00.485 --> 00:02:03.085
I can't say I love this,
but I don't love that, no.

00:02:03.085 --> 00:02:04.918
100% love myself.

00:02:10.653 --> 00:02:12.820
(chiming)

